  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Trap. When Barbed Trap is triggered, all nearby foes are struck for 7...20...23 piercing damage, become Crippled, and begin Bleeding for 3...21...25 seconds. Barbed Trap ends after 90 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.",
      "zhTW": "當荊棘陷阱被觸動時，對陷阱附近的所有敵人造成 7～23 穿刺傷害，使他們遭受「殘廢」及「流血」病症 3～25 秒。荊棘陷阱在 90 秒後消失。此技能發動時容易被中斷。"
    },
    "pvp": null
  },
